	<Comments><Comment><Identifier>(0x00000070, 0x00000001)</Identifier><Text>SSVEP media controller. Open ssvep_music_targets.html in a 60 Hz browser window. 10 Hz left target sends Windows Media Play once after 3 confirmed windows. 15 Hz right target sends Windows Media Pause once after 3 confirmed windows. After a command, 4 consecutive neutral windows are required before re-arming; a 5 second media cooldown also applies. Channel 9 is a starting value; replace it with the actual posterior electrode channel if needed.</Text><Attributes><Attribute><Identifier>(0x473d9a43, 0x97fc0a97)</Identifier><Value>32</Value></Attribute><Attribute><Identifier>(0x7234b86b, 0x2b8651a5)</Identifier><Value>640</Value></Attribute></Attributes></Comment></Comments>
